title: "Throttled-ESCE Hybrid Load Balancer: reference implementation and CloudAnalyst experiments"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a cost-efficient hybrid load balancer that
  combines Throttled and Equally Spread Current Execution policies with
  tri-level load thresholds, capacity-aware scoring and elastic scaling for
  heterogeneous cloud environments.
